title: SalWorkshopTS1
color: green
position: -237,-112
---
<<if get_flag("metSul")>>
The man acnowledge you without moving his eyes from his work.
Sully: Hey Kher, can I help you? 
-> How can I get in the workshop?<<if get_flag_uncheck("keys")>>
	<<detour sullyGetIn>>
-> Can you give me your keys?<<if get_flag("sullyKeys")>>
	<<detour sullyKey>>
-> Zoe wants to talk to you <<if get_flag("zoeAsk")>>
	<<detour sulOfficeReq>>
-> Do you know how can I get an extension? <<if get_flag("deadDad") and get_flag_uncheck("SDA")>>
	<<detour sullyExtension>>
-> Do you know who might have my dad's documents? <<if get_flag("SDA")>>
	<<detour sullyHick>>
-> Thanks, see you later
	<<return>>
<<jump SalWorkshopTS1>>

<<elseif true>>
	The old man's eyes light up when he sees you 
	Sully: hey kid you made it.
	<<detour meetSully>>
	<<jump SalWorkshopTS1>>
<<endif>>
